    "testimonials_FqAwzT": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_767mcf": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "This is a really solid piece of furniture. The material feels durable and it's well put together. You can tell it's going to last. Would buy from here again.",
            "author": "Scarlett U.",
            "product": "chicago-luxvelvet-3-seater"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_KtBW7D": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "We're doing up our house and this was one of the first big purchases. It's completely set the tone for the living room. The quality is top-notch, feels really solid and well-made, not like some of the flimsy stuff you see elsewhere. It's also way more comfortable than I thought it would be - perfect for movie nights. The measurements were spot on too, fits the alcove perfectly. So, so happy.",
            "author": "Michael F.",
            "product": "garrison-corner"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Y3ggPR": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Top-notch quality and surprisingly quick turnaround. We needed a replacement for our old family sofa and didn't have the luxury of waiting months for a custom build. This arrived within 10 days of ordering. The stitching is perfect and the material feels like it will actually stand up to kids and pets. My only tiny gripe was the delivery slot was very early in the morning, but given the speed and the build quality of the furniture, I really can't complain. It's rare to find a company that actually delivers on its 'fast delivery' promises!",
            "author": "Ellie",
            "product": "oakland-corner-sofa"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_9yqi4A": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Finally!\n\nThis is a really solid piece of furniture. The material feels durable and it's well put together. You can tell it's going to last. Would buy from here again.",
            "author": "Ryan X.",
            "product": "best-capsule-3000-pillow-top-mattress"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_CFLGaC": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "So lush\n\nWe searched for *months* to find the perfect corner sofa that wasn't ridiculously expensive. Stumbled across this site and took a chance. It paid off! The pictures are good, but it's even nicer in reality. The velvet is so soft and the colour is gorgeous and rich. The delivery guys were legends, super friendly and careful. The whole process was smooth. If you're on the fence, just go for it.",
            "author": "George H.",
            "product": "capsule-orthopaedic-mattress"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_cnj6A4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Finally!\n\nLove.",
            "author": "Tyler R.",
            "product": "chicago-crushed-velvet-3-seater"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_NaxwHn": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 4,
            "content": "Looks just like it does on the website, which is always a relief! The delivery guys were great, brought it right into the room for me.",
            "author": "Zoey S.",
            "product": "fullerton-bed"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_iLi3wq": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "This is my second purchase from this store and the quality is just as good as the first time. I knew I could trust them for a big item like a bed. The ottoman storage is a game-changer, so much space in there. The headboard is really plush and comfortable to lean against. It feels like a proper hotel bed! The whole thing is really sturdy. Can't fault it.",
            "author": "Aurora I.",
            "product": "chicago-luxvelvet-32-seater"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_EakgYg": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "I saw this on an interior design Instagram account and fell in love. It's just as beautiful in real life. The craftsmanship is excellent, from the frame to the upholstery. It arrived on the day they said it would, and the delivery process was seamless. It was easy to assemble the legs and it looks absolutely stunning. I've already passed the website details on to my sister.",
            "author": "Henry U.",
            "product": "byron-corner-sofa"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_NdLfCT": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "This is my second purchase from this store and the quality is just as good as the first time. I knew I could trust them for a big item like a bed. The ottoman storage is a game-changer, so much space in there. The headboard is really plush and comfortable to lean against. It feels like a proper hotel bed! The whole thing is really sturdy. Can't fault it.",
            "author": "Lucas P.",
            "product": "best-capsule-3000-pillow-top-mattress"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_biJpwQ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "3 settee and 2 settee great comfy happy with the colour great choice same about the drver getting wrong address said it dead end but yeah got it delivered",
            "author": "Nicole Grey",
            "product": "dino-32-seater"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_rTbw8M": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "TOP QUALITY SOFA! Our sofa was so great, and really cheap for what it is ! I was a bit hesitant first but when our sofa arrived it couldn't believe it! Really pleased!",
            "author": "Kayla",
            "product": "verona-full-back-corner-sofa"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Y3eAFJ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "I ordered this sofa and was very pleased! It looks much better in person and is very comfortable and they're pricing is very cheap compare to others!",
            "author": "John",
            "product": "garrison-plush-velvet-corner-sofa-copy"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_C4HfWg": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Absolutely delighted with my new corner sofa. I’d been looking for a specific velvet finish and most places were quoting months for delivery, but this arrived in just under a week. You can really tell the difference in the frame quality—it feels solid and well-built, not like some of the flimsy flat-pack options out there. The delivery drivers were also a credit to the company; they were punctual, polite, and even took the packaging away with them. Five-star service from start to finish!",
            "author": "Liz",
            "product": "chicago-luxvelvet-corner-sofa"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_fy9mQ7": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "I was a bit nervous about ordering a sofa online without trying it first, but I needed something quickly after moving into my new flat. I’m so impressed! The delivery was incredibly fast—ordered on Tuesday and it was in my living room by Friday morning. The quality is much better than the 'big name' high street brands I’ve had before; the fabric feels durable and the cushions are firm but supportive. Great communication from the delivery team too. Highly recommend if you don't want to wait 12 weeks for a sofa!",
            "author": "Joanne",
            "product": "oakland-corner-sofa"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_XjXfJJ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Stunning\n\nSo pleased with this. The fabric is softer than I expected and it looks so much more expensive than it was.",
            "author": "Benjamin A.",
            "product": "oakland-2-seater"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_QqdaNd": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Completely changed the vibe of my living room.\n\nWe searched for *months* to find the perfect corner sofa that wasn't ridiculously expensive. Stumbled across this site and took a chance. It paid off! The pictures are good, but it's even nicer in reality. The velvet is so soft and the colour is gorgeous and rich. The delivery guys were legends, super friendly and careful. The whole process was smooth. If you're on the fence, just go for it.",
            "author": "Isla F.",
            "product": "capsule-orthopaedic-mattress"
